<title>GERMANY: Weru 1996 sales fell, profit rose.</title>
<headline>Weru 1996 sales fell, profit rose.</headline>
<dateline>RUDERSBERG, Germany 1997-03-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>Calendar 1996</p>
<p>(in millions of marks unless stated)</p>
<p>    Group sales				  452.8   vs 500.6</p>
<p>    Group earnings from ord. activities  31.5    vs 15.5</p>
<p>    Group cash flow			    61.7    vs 48.5</p>
<p>NOTE - Full name of the German window manufacturer is Weru AG. The profit figure, which is in line with figures already released in January, is provisional. Weru also repeated that it expected to maintain its earnings at 1996 levels this year and said its business in the first two months supported that forecast.</p>
<p>--Frankfurt Newsroom, +49 69 756525</p>
</text>
